WEBVTT

00:06:29.156 --> 00:06:33.436
So sometimes it can take six months
to get the results back to the farmer.

00:06:33.476 --> 00:06:35.196
And by then, it's too late.

00:06:35.236 --> 00:06:36.836
The crop is already gone,

00:06:36.836 --> 00:06:40.036
which results in further poverty
and more hunger.

00:06:41.316 --> 00:06:43.476
We knew we could fix this.

00:06:43.996 --> 00:06:45.396
In 2017,

00:06:45.396 --> 00:06:50.196
we had heard of this handheld,
portable DNA sequencer

00:06:50.236 --> 00:06:52.716
called an Oxford Nanopore MinION.

00:06:52.756 --> 00:06:56.916
This was being used
in West Africa to fight Ebola.

00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.436
So we thought:

00:06:58.436 --> 00:07:01.756
Why can't we use this
in East Africa to help farmers?